  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacity in the energy and AFOLU sectors for enhanced transparency (CBIT Benin) (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Preparation Grant (PPG) phase aims at the preparation of the documentation required for submission of the Medium-Size Project (MSP) for approval by FAO and endorsement by the GEF Chief Executive Officer (CEO). The PPG phase will include: i) development of a comprehensive stakeholder engagement plan accompanied by consultation with stakeholders to be engaged in the project implementation phase; ii) needs assessment of stakeholders in preparation for the three components; and iii) information synthesis, finalization of project design and budgeting.</narrative>
  </description>
